  3.423415835278742*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7529ca9d-c1c6-4013-9615-\
190908e5efe7"],

Cell["\<\
FeynRules can check whether all the values of the masses given in the model \
file ar ein agreement with the masses given in the Lagrangian:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.423415751305388*^9, 
  3.423415792594919*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0881f5ec-e751-40b6-9b84-\
b6a106314f53"],

Cell["\<\
Note that, although the FR will warning that the mass terms seem not \
diagonal. But when subsituting the relation of lambda/m112/m222 in terms of \
physical parameters, you will see that these terms are actually 0.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.776426725920356*^9, 
  3.776426850030518*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e19187a4-d8e0-4c2c-95d8-\
a0b4c8429af3"],

